+# Spec: IronClaude commands as Orca workers (worker contract)
+
+Task: task_1376c0449d24 (Task 4, write the spec); revised by task_6eefc528c8e0 (Task 6) on 2026-11-08 against `.dev/orca-command-refactor/review/spec-panel.md`, with one disposition row per finding in `.dev/orca-command-refactor/review/disposition.md`. Planning only: nothing here is implemented.
+Repo root: all paths are repo-relative unless absolute. The run README names `/home/coder/workspaces/worktrees/IronClaude/OrcaCLICommandRefactor-Specs` (`.dev/orca-command-refactor/README.md:8`), which does not exist on this machine; the review and this revision resolved every relative path in `/home/coder/workspaces/worktrees/IronClaude/exp346-ab-ctl-r1`.
+Inputs: `.dev/orca-command-refactor/inventory/commands-a.md`, `.dev/orca-command-refactor/inventory/commands-b.md`, `.dev/orca-command-refactor/inventory/orca-capabilities.md`, and the evidence list in `.dev/orca-command-refactor/README.md:11-17`.
+
