+| SA-6 | The existing headless rule of `/sc:reflect` under `claude --print` keeps working exactly as today; `--unattended` reuses it and does not replace it. | The reflect wrapper depends on it. | `sk/sc-reflect-protocol/refs/remediation-handoff.md:239-247`; `sk/sc-reflect-protocol/SKILL.md:320-322` |
