+Each phase is one written plan executed under the repo's level-3 route (`/sc:workflow`, then `/sc:implement` when execution is requested), because each touches more than one source file (hard limit at `src/superclaude/core/CLAUDE.md:65` and `src/superclaude/core/HOW-WE-WORK.md:22`).
